OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after woman foils fake
OL,4,Apolice scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who outsmarted a scammer
OL,7,Fclaiming to be a police officer is now
OL,8,Fspreading awareness so others can also
OL,9,Favoid falling into a trap.
OL,11,FAnn Turtle, from Orleton in
OL,12,FHerefordshire, was called by a
OL,13,F"so-called officer" who said he had
OL,14,Farrested someone in London who had
OL,15,Fcloned her card.
OL,17,FThe scammer introduced himself as
OL,18,F"Detective Mason" and told her to ring
OL,19,F999 to verify he was a real police
OL,20,Fofficer but Turtle, whose son is a real
OL,21,FPC, knew that was not normal procedure.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
