OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after woman foils fake
OL,4,Apolice scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer warning comes as West Mercia Police
OL,7,Fissued advice against scammers saying
OL,8,Fno police officer would ask anyone to
OL,9,Fmake a payment or purchase, withdraw or
OL,10,Ftransfer money or ask for bank details.
